# ripgrep (and tools built on it) skip these: dated proof, proposals and
# generated data drown code in search results. Search them with `rg -uu` or by
# naming the path, e.g. `rg landing docs/testing`.
docs/testing/
docs/verification/
docs/proposals/
docs/release-notes-*.md
docs/adr/test-pruning-review.md
packages/model-registry/data/models-dev-snapshot.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
